iii) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator before whom the aforesaid petitions filed by the respondents are pending, is hereby directed to club / tag the dispute involved in the present writ petition also along with pending petitions and dispose of the same together in accordance with law;
iv) Liberty is reserved in favour of the petitioners herein to file pleadings, documents,
NC: 2023:KHC:20446 etc. in the matters referred to the Deputy Commissioner/
Statutory Arbitrator pursuant to this order;
v) All rival contentions are kept open and no opinion is expressed on the same;
vi) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator is directed to dispose of all the proceedings including the proceedings referred to under this order, within a period of six months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
vii) It is made clear that this order is restricted to the petitioners only and is made in the peculiar/ special facts and circumstances of the instant case and shall not be treated as a precedent nor having any precedential value for any purpose whatsoever."
